   - Include a disclaimer or message revealing the hoax at the end.

**6. User Experience:**
   - After a few seconds, display a message stating the site is a hoax.
   - Add a button to reveal the real story to provide a way to exit the hoax.

**Example Layout:**
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
